#. module: l10n_ar_arca_edi_export
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ar_arca_edi_export.field_res_country__l10n_ar_arca_cuit_pais
msgid ""
"Code ARCA assigns to each country to identify the foreign taxpayer in WSFEXv1 (Cuit_pais_cliente). It is a table of ARCA's own, distinct from the country code (l10n_ar_afip_code) the core already ships.\n"
"\n"
"It comes empty: the full table was not obtained from an official ARCA source, and filling in some 200 countries by deduction would be worse than leaving it blank (the module raises a clear error when it is missing, instead of sending a wrong number). Fill in the destination country by hand before invoicing an export to it, checking the official ARCA CUIT País table."
msgstr ""

